  "publicTitle": "Fix connectivity listener updates with an uninitialized cache",
  "visiblePRDescription": "## Summary\n\n- Keep vertex and edge additions safe before full connectivity computation and after cache invalidation.\n- Clear individually cached components on edge additions while retaining lazy computation and existing incremental updates for initialized caches.\n- Add directed and undirected regression tests for initial updates, removal/addition sequences, and partial component queries.\n- Prepared with Codex assistance.\n\n## Testing\n\nFixes #1162",
